---

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph API_Process ["API Process — stateless, ROLE=api"]
        direction TB
        AUTH["Auth Middleware<br/>Entra JWT verify (stateless)"]
        RL["Rate Limiter<br/>Redis global per IP / user"]
        ROUTES["Routes<br/>documents · jobs · me · billing · health/ready"]
        VAL["Validators<br/>ext, magic bytes, script/macro scan, archive bomb"]
        QUOTA["Quota — atomic DB statement<br/>UPDATE balance WHERE > 0"]
        ADAP["Adapters<br/>Storage / DB / Queue / Model"]
        PROD["Queue Producer<br/>BullMQ enqueue (Redis)"]
    end

    subgraph Shared_Adapters ["Shared Adapter Layer (swappable)"]
        direction TB
        ST_ADAP["Storage Adapter<br/>MinIO ↔ R2 ↔ S3"]
        DB_ADAP["DB Adapter<br/>Postgres ↔ D1 (test only)"]
        MQ_ADAP["Queue Adapter<br/>BullMQ (Redis)"]
        MDL_ADAP["Model Adapter<br/>Mock ↔ Modal HTTP"]
    end

    subgraph Worker_Process ["Worker Process — ROLE=worker"]
        direction TB
        CONS["Queue Consumer<br/>BullMQ pull + stall recovery"]
        EXTR["Extractors<br/>pdf / docx / pptx / txt / md / rtf / odt<br/>+ OCR per page if scanned"]
        STRUCT["Structure<br/>2-level heading tree + IR blocks"]
        CHUNK["Chunker<br/>1 chunk / subheading, assets separated"]
        ASSETS["Assets<br/>images sanitize (sharp) · tables sanitize"]
        LLM["LLM Adapter<br/>compression + verification"]
        VERIFY["Verify / Completeness<br/>fact preservation + schema validate"]
        RETAIN["Retention / Deletion<br/>7-day upload TTL + decree"]
    end

    API_Process --> Shared_Adapters
    Shared_Adapters --> Worker_Process
    API_Process --> PROD --> Shared_Adapters
    Worker_Process --> Shared_Adapters

    style API_Process fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px
    style Shared_Adapters fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    style Worker_Process fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px
```

**Key:** api and worker both depend on adapter layer; providers swapped by env only. No coupling to MinIO, Postgres, Mock, or Modal.

**Parent:** L1 (zoomed node: `api` and `worker`). **Child:** L3 (zoom into `Worker_Process` pipeline sequence).
